{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "upwork-workflow-generator", "elements": [{"id": "rectangle_21", "type": "rectangle", "x": -104, "y": -102, "width": 352, "height": 310, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9db7e6", "backgroundColor": "#e7f0fd", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1836494975, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1349251824, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_22", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -86, "width": 308, "height": 55, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e4f9c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1999744785, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1946412081, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - TRELLO AND DRIVE\nEVENTS COME IN", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 - TRELLO AND DRIVE\nEVENTS COME IN", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_23", "type": "text", "x": -82, "y": -23, "width": 308, "height": 81, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1552984409, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1287489454, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Two ways in. A Trello card is created or\nmoved to a new list, or a file lands in a\nwatched Drive folder. Make allows one\ntrigger per scenario, so this ships as two\nscenarios that share everything downstream.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Two ways in. A Trello card is created or\nmoved to a new list, or a file lands in a\nwatched Drive folder. Make allows one\ntrigger per scenario, so this ships as two\nscenarios that share everything downstream.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_24", "type": "rectangle", "x": 448, "y": -42, "width": 700, "height": 250, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#9fd1a8", "backgroundColor": "#e8f6ea", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1066984056, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 772092315, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_25", "type": "text", "x": 470, "y": -26, "width": 656, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1f6b30", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1048386556, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 351564608, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 - ROUTE TO THE RIGHT TEAM CHANNEL", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 - ROUTE TO THE RIGHT TEAM CHANNEL", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_26", "type": "text", "x": 470, "y": 9, "width": 656, "height": 49, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1289560150, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2126508551, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "One table holds team to channel. The board or list name on a Trello card, or the folder name\non a Drive file, picks the arm. Anything unrecognised falls to the default arm so nothing is\nlost.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "One table holds team to channel. The board or list name on a Trello card, or the folder name\non a Drive file, picks the arm. Anything unrecognised falls to the default arm so nothing is\nlost.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_27", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1346, "y": -106, "width": 1048, "height": 474, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c7a6e3", "backgroundColor": "#f3e9fb", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1475216846, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1927728187, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_28", "type": "text", "x": 1368, "y": -90, "width": 1004, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#5b2c8c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1236683273, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 314395343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 - POST TO SLACK", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 - POST TO SLACK", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_29", "type": "text", "x": 1368, "y": -54, "width": 1004, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 507088657, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1795823849, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "The message is built once, then posted into the private channel for that team. Card updates and file uploads read differently, so each gets\nits own wording and its own link back.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "The message is built once, then posted into the private channel for that team. Card updates and file uploads read differently, so each gets\nits own wording and its own link back.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_30", "type": "rectangle", "x": 2574, "y": -66, "width": 1068, "height": 394, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e6c97a", "backgroundColor": "#fff5df", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 708506837, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1469118511, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_31", "type": "text", "x": 2596, "y": -50, "width": 1024, "height": 28, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#8a5a00", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 652768598, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2100080515, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "4 - KEEP IT RELIABLE", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 22, "containerId": null, "originalText": "4 - KEEP IT RELIABLE", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "text_32", "type": "text", "x": 2596, "y": -14, "width": 1024, "height": 32, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#4a4a4a", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1811180650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 168393880, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Every post is checked. A refused post alerts ops instead of vanishing, and every notification lands in an audit sheet so you can prove what\nfired and when.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Every post is checked. A refused post alerts ops instead of vanishing, and every notification lands in an audit sheet so you can prove what\nfired and when.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false}, {"id": "rectangle_1", "type": "rectangle", "x": -68, "y": 88, "width": 280, "height": 84, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2d6a4f", "backgroundColor": "#b7e4c7", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1.5, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1390851129, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 647892280, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"type": "text", "id": "text_2"}, {"type": "arrow", "id": "arrow_33"}], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "text_2", "type": "text", "x": -56.0, "y": 111.25, "width": 256, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1695753999, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 207388625, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 - Trello Card or Drive File\nEvent Arrives", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "baseline": 15, "containerId": "rectangle_1", "originalText": "1 - Trello Card or Drive File\nEvent Arrives", "line